{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:50:29Z","created_by_operation":"op_f4e4d7a389ea4c16ab474da00f345f50","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_182f5fc591e4930b27cf89ccbec5306b9840efb047fad94277b50d3b8c5e2783","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"fareedkhan-dev/multi-agent-training-grpo@48758c5e67e7 snapshot 57f32112a4bb2240","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_880a43c26ca3e2ac2fd6836724ab09218ef430d3e9a07eac7c32bb7af8d54504","slc_89cdcf6aa65b7f6429f46fb0eb4959dc0d6148bb081c74dd9a01b23fece0701f","slc_9b73ff66cb069fdd8fad7c6064803460e1974aa6d8fc96b47a2f89a63c4d5090","slc_a50e4051c89e7ee0a7d26ed0bbb73fb47059ffc72e0a026a6a0d1fd7d42e3dcd"],"source_ids":["src_4bfa8cc503ac5736bf465d93c8d86ac8"],"text":"The planning model is served through a vLLM server with an OpenAI-compatible API; the example serves Qwen/Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct on port 8000 with an API key and 8192 max context length.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:50:29Z","updated_by_operation":"op_f4e4d7a389ea4c16ab474da00f345f50"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:50:29Z","created_by_operation":"op_f4e4d7a389ea4c16ab474da00f345f50","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_231a11370b0adf1e6857ec602bbde8981e9e8dee3277ce5c2f4030de8fdc8087","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"fareedkhan-dev/multi-agent-training-grpo@48758c5e67e7 snapshot 57f32112a4bb2240","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_10c20493bc13cb8c8388bd4b009a431c809930d41e4242d707754d1c3c75d76d"],"source_ids":["src_4bfa8cc503ac5736bf465d93c8d86ac8"],"text":"Tool API keys are configured as placeholders: an OpenAI key is noted as needed for embeddings in the web search tool and a Google key for the Google search tool.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:50:29Z","updated_by_operation":"op_f4e4d7a389ea4c16ab474da00f345f50"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:50:29Z","created_by_operation":"op_f4e4d7a389ea4c16ab474da00f345f50","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_33cada1c29493fad7230c47babb74cae8304e4eca6f32aeb924e7aa96dd8689f","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"fareedkhan-dev/multi-agent-training-grpo@48758c5e67e7 snapshot 57f32112a4bb2240","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_9e2ff3ddbf595fe23134759d6e8804a4ee059d0cd16858bea721be8f4e6215d5"],"source_ids":["src_4bfa8cc503ac5736bf465d93c8d86ac8"],"text":"The multi-agent architecture comprises stages including planning, tool use, execution, observation and reflection, iteration until a verifier agent determines the query is answered, and final synthesis.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:50:29Z","updated_by_operation":"op_f4e4d7a389ea4c16ab474da00f345f50"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:50:29Z","created_by_operation":"op_f4e4d7a389ea4c16ab474da00f345f50","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_5938e0db067c81f5ec34e7348f766562e74ed3bb7b797d07621932dce84ce234","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=evaluation","setting":"fareedkhan-dev/multi-agent-training-grpo@48758c5e67e7 snapshot 57f32112a4bb2240","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_e145e83158b42f38019f3c5f95b278be86f1f53a68f620ba0e8ca8d75b6f550d"],"source_ids":["src_4bfa8cc503ac5736bf465d93c8d86ac8"],"text":"During GRPO training, an external judge scores each trajectory's final answer against ground truth with binary rewards (1.0 correct, 0.0 failed or hallucinated), and relative advantages are computed against the group mean.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:50:29Z","updated_by_operation":"op_f4e4d7a389ea4c16ab474da00f345f50"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:50:29Z","created_by_operation":"op_f4e4d7a389ea4c16ab474da00f345f50","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_77cbfdd8444aaae10e28ccbe4c26d4f8c3fe0a796a2222b134d51a62542f3217","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"fareedkhan-dev/multi-agent-training-grpo@48758c5e67e7 snapshot 57f32112a4bb2240","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_09c7c580466c163fe43e9cb67aac4b244c1abe51149d47cadd6a8680db2855dc","slc_1528aecf16b6041688142689498fe42e427c24fc06048d544b1eb712b24df952","slc_3703d71c4cfff6ac724885ecf7a4d5244200eadeb5e4a42ab352ddfca75dfaf3"],"source_ids":["src_4bfa8cc503ac5736bf465d93c8d86ac8"],"text":"The project trains a multi-agent system with the GRPO reinforcement learning algorithm to improve planning and reduce hallucination and off-track results in long-horizon agentic tasks.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:50:29Z","updated_by_operation":"op_f4e4d7a389ea4c16ab474da00f345f50"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:50:29Z","created_by_operation":"op_f4e4d7a389ea4c16ab474da00f345f50","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_96ac528a0049f79ba9a5e4924781610eebc1281270d5e65748f34db8311214e8","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"fareedkhan-dev/multi-agent-training-grpo@48758c5e67e7 snapshot 57f32112a4bb2240","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2d5dc85787c16661b51ebdaa8d0b9c7a09b530f614237d37606c051c3600130c","slc_933d94b9147ed9906d3e546fd31069ac263aad6bb214a444b3cf2f8ecfbdf3b1"],"source_ids":["src_4bfa8cc503ac5736bf465d93c8d86ac8"],"text":"The tutorial targets the planning phase for fine-tuning because it monitors the whole workflow across iterations, and uses an open-source vLLM-based server chosen for throughput and latency; the author used a single A100 80GB GPU.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:50:29Z","updated_by_operation":"op_f4e4d7a389ea4c16ab474da00f345f50"}
